  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Main journey",
      "items": [
        "POST /api/session: a new principal in an HttpOnly cookie (needs the token when one is set)",
        "POST /api/chat plans; POST /api/runs starts the orchestrator on the caller's own planId, once",
        "The UI polls GET /api/runs/:id — only the owner can read or confirm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Controls in server code",
      "items": [
        "Server-inserted probes, forced confirm on submit, egress = user hosts ∩ server allowlist",
        "Plans and runs carry owner = principal; foreign ids answer 404",
        "Fair, bounded SlotPool: SANDBOX_MAX_CONCURRENT slots, round-robin by principal; receipt hashed and signed after destroy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Still not protected",
      "items": [
        "Anyone holding the token can mint many sessions; global caps bound the damage",
        "Limits and sessions are in memory, one process",
        "MockSandbox runs no code: isolation is simulated, not proven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Mode switch",
      "items": [
        "MOCK defaults to on; only MOCK=0 selects the Vultr stubs",
        "VultrInferenceLlm (Vultr Serverless Inference) and VultrSandbox (Docker + gVisor VM) are planned stubs that throw; nothing calls Vultr",
        "PROOFBOX_PUBLIC=1 refuses to start without PROOFBOX_DEMO_TOKEN and RECEIPT_SIGNING_KEY; local mode answers loopback Host only"
      ]
    }
  ]
